  {
   "id": "daydream-forgotten-sorrow-167270@3",
   "gameId": "daydream-forgotten-sorrow-167270",
   "displayName": "Update 3",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-07-05T13:10:42.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello daydreamers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Here's Update #3, so soon!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "CHAPTER 1",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "(Father's study) added a moving lamp above the head of the animal;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added tips in the form of bars under the animal pictures with the years;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug with the camera, if you reload, you move on the axes of XY - the movement should be on the camera axes;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "(Mother's room) Griffin cannot die falling from a height;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The room with the ventilator (the problematic one) - you can't die after falling from a height.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "CHAPTER 2",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added illumination on the place where the bear is hanging in the cobweb (where you have to go up after the torch goes out);",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Additional save line was added in the same place;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In front of the fishing line a save line was added;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Because of the change of speed Griffin can run away from the spider after the puzzle with the trap (where there is still a flower);",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the place where you have to lead the spider in the cage (puzzle with levers) Griffin cannot fall down if you get up and go to the left;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Removed beams from the floor that looked like a prohibition to move down;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changed the camera at the end of the escape from the grease where you have to jump on a hook.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "OUTSIDE THE MILL",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Changed the camera on the right side from the bottom;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the whole chapter you go right to left in the XY of the chamber;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a new spinning platform to jump on;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The flatbed with the bike is now a little lower than before;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changed the collision of the bag of hay on which you need to climb.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "THE CHAPTER WITH MIRA",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "On places where there are stairs to safely descend - you cannot die if you jump (2 places);",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you fall from the crane, you cannot die.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "THE FACTORY",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "You can't die when falling from the robot's head;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can't die if you fall from the puzzle (from the crane) located on top of the house (after the puzzle with the gear wheel, which must be melted down).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks for the feedback, dear daydreamers! It really helps to make Daydream: Forgotten Sorrow better!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "About the game",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Daydream: Forgotten Sorrow stars a boy named Griffin as he embarks on a journey to face his fears alongside his teddy bear companion Birly. As Griffin learns to confront haunting memories amidst floating castles and enchanted forests, he’ll come to discover the mystery of this newfound world.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Key Features",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A touching story made for everyone",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Command an adorable teddy bear companion",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Intelligent puzzles",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "A charming and mysterious universe",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Unbridled (and sometimes scary!) fantasy fun",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Find Daydream: Forgotten Sorrow on social media",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "► Twitter",
